        "created_at": "2014-08-18T23:05:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Don't forget, he heals after every power use, not just the first.</p><p>-Gung Ho</p><p>--Heal YL 1<br>--Atomic Glare</p><p>---Deal 3 damage to Iron Legacy</p><p>--Iron Legacy heals 2 (from Atomic Glare)</p><p>-Iron Legacy heals 2 (from Gung Ho)</p><p>So, Iron Legacy is at full hit points after all of that.</p>",
