        "created_at": "2014-08-18T23:19:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Doesn't the effect of IL happen on using the power, not resolution?</p><p>GL uses a power, which heals IL 2 (he's already at full)</p><p>GL chooses YL to use a power</p><p>YL uses a power, Which heals IL2&nbsp;<span>(he's still already at full)</span></p><p><span>YL chooses to targets IL and hits him for net 3.</span></p><p><span>Or am I completely wrong?</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>EDIT: Curses! Ninja'ed and pointed out I am wrong, how horrible.</span></p>",
