        "created_at": "2014-08-18T23:31:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Well I guess I’ll just bring more pain on</p>\n<p>America’s Newest Legacy</p>\n<p>HP: 26<br>\nHand: Bolster Allies, Surge of Strength, Inspiring Presense, Danger Sense</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Start<br>\nPlay: Inspiring Presense each hero gains 1 HP GL[23], FL[25], and myself [27]. I take 3 damage from IL [24]<br>\nPower: Atomic Glare - I deal net 5 energy damage [27] and IL heals for 2 [29]<br>\nDraw: Fortitude<br>\nEnd</h2>\n<p>HP: 24<br>\nHand: Bolster Allies, Surge of Strength, Danger Sense<br>\nIn Play: Inspiring Presense<br>\nTrash:<br>\nEffects: Increase damage by heroes by 1</p>",
